1
00:00:00,068 --> 00:00:02,098
(Sheldon:)...when I look in your eyes...

2
00:00:02,304 --> 00:00:04,564
(Sheldon:)...and you're looking back in mine...

3
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:06,500
(Sheldon:)...everything feels...

4
00:00:06,675 --> 00:00:08,545
(Sheldon:)...not quite normal...

5
00:00:08,744 --> 00:00:10,574
(Sheldon:)...because I feel...

6
00:00:11,013 --> 00:00:14,343
(Sheldon:)...stronger and weaker at the same time.

7
00:00:14,516 --> 00:00:17,006
(Sheldon:)I feel excited...

8
00:00:17,185 --> 00:00:20,245
(Sheldon:)...and at the same time, terrified.

9
00:00:21,423 --> 00:00:22,683
(Sheldon:)The truth is...

10
00:00:22,958 --> 00:00:26,048
(Sheldon:)...I don't know what I feel...

11
00:00:26,228 --> 00:00:29,358
(Sheldon:)...except I know what kind of man
I want to be.

12
00:00:31,366 --> 00:00:33,066
(Penny:)Sheldon.

13
00:00:33,602 --> 00:00:34,862
(Amy:)That was beautiful.

14
00:00:35,037 --> 00:00:38,867
(Sheldon:)I should hope so,
that's from the first Spider-Man movie.

15
00:00:43,545 --> 00:00:45,065
(Amy:)I'll take it.

16
00:00:46,982 --> 00:00:50,472
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Good.
Now, I assume we're splitting the check?

17
00:00:55,057 --> 00:00:57,257
- Hey, Stuart.
- Oh, hey.

18
00:00:57,559 --> 00:00:59,219
(Stuart:)I was actually just about to close.

